WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.417
Six panels. Where do I start?
Open A, then F, to compare two views of the same cells.

00:00:07.417 --> 00:00:16.417
PCA again. What does it mean here?
Select the acronym to see its full name and where the authors define it on page 7.

00:00:16.417 --> 00:00:25.000
Where did the authors actually say that?
Open the caption in the PDF. The sentence is highlighted on page 10.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:33.667
Do I have to explain the whole figure to ask one question?
Ask how long sampling lasted. The source guide finds the answer in the caption on page 10.

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:43.667
Which page did this slide come from?
Add the panel and a speaking note. Open the slide to see the figure and page together.
